Package: tela-soplos-icons
Version: 1.0.0-3
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: hicolor-icon-theme
Recommends: adwaita-icon-theme, breeze-icon-theme
Maintainer: Sergi Perich <info@soploslinux.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/SoplosLinux/tela-soplos-icons
Description: Tela Soplos icon themes (default, dark and light) for Soplos Linux.
 Icon themes for Soplos Linux based on the Tela ubuntu icon theme and
 recolored with the official Soplos palette. Three variants are installed in
 /usr/share/icons: Tela Soplos, Tela Soplos Dark and Tela Soplos Light.
 .
 Based on Tela (https://github.com/vinceliuice/Tela-icon-theme). Soplos
 modifications by Sergi Perich and Simnandez.
 Build date: 2026-11-14
